@startuml
!include common.iuml
title Complaint lifecycle (FR-005)
[*] --> New : citizen submits
New --> Assigned : routed to agent
Assigned --> InProgress : agent starts work
InProgress --> PendingInfo : agent asks citizen
PendingInfo --> InProgress : citizen replies\n(Sprint 3 Task 7)
InProgress --> Resolved : agent resolves\n(notes required)
Resolved --> InProgress : citizen reopens
Resolved --> Closed : citizen rates or closes;\nsystem after 7 days
Closed --> [*]
state "In Progress" as InProgress
state "Pending Info" as PendingInfo
@enduml
